<title>BELGIUM: Belgian OLO exchange auction totals 61.25 bln bfr.</title>
<headline>Belgian OLO exchange auction totals 61.25 bln bfr.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Belgian Treasury said its</p>
<p>linear government bond (OLO) exchange auction totalled 61.25</p>
<p>billion Belgian francs.</p>
<p> OLOs offered *		 amount of new OLOs sold (in bln bfr)</p>
<p> code 264 7.00% 1999	  zero</p>
<p> code 252 9.00% 2001	  zero</p>
<p> code 251 9.00% 2003	  zero</p>
<p> code 273 6.50% 2005	  11.54</p>
<p> code 286 6.25% 2007	  49.71</p>
<p>NOTE - * in exchange for 61.05 bln bfr of OLO (code) 248.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
</text>
